   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Givarkonf 2004</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kulturenheten skall organisera tv&#xE5; givarkonferenser f&#xF6;r att samordna och samarbeta inom respektive omr&#xE5;den med andra internationella givare. En kulturkonferens 26-27 februari 2004 samt en mediekonferens 4-5 mars 2004.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Culture &amp; Media Division will organize two donors meetings in order to co-ordinate and co-operate with the areas of other  international donors respectively. A culture conference will be arranged February 26-27, 2004 and media conference March 4-5, 2004.</narrative>
  </description>
